+# Voxra.gg
 
+Production-focused blueprint and implementation starter for **Voxra**, a premium gamer communication SaaS platform.
+
+## Stack
+- Frontend: Next.js 14 + React 18 + TypeScript
+- Realtime: WebSockets/SSE and WebRTC voice token flow
+- Backend target: Node.js microservices (Phase A scaffold included)
+- Data target: Postgres + Redis (next phase)
+- Edge/hosting target: Cloudflare + AWS
+
+## Included in this repository
+- High-conversion homepage and web app shell (`app/page.tsx`)
+- Dark/light design system (`app/globals.css` + theme toggle)
+- **Phase A working core UI** (`app/beta/page.tsx` + `app/components/PhaseAConsole.tsx`)
+- **Phase A backend services** (`services/*`)
+  - Auth mock OAuth/session service
+  - Squad service (party-up/join/disband)
+  - Voice token service (signed ephemeral tokens)
+  - Realtime service (SSE stream + message post)
+- Product architecture and scale plan (`docs/architecture.md`)
+- API contract starter (`api/openapi.yaml`)
+- Brand/UI kit guidance (`docs/ui-brand-kit.md`)
+- Deployment pipeline (`.github/workflows/ci-cd.yml`)
+- Performance and SEO strategy (`docs/perf-seo.md`)
+
+## Quick start
+```bash
+# optional if registry access works
+npm install
+
+# run backend services for phase A
+npm run services:start
+
+# in another terminal, run frontend
+npm run dev
+```
+
+## Environment
+Copy `.env.example` to `.env.local` for frontend and service configuration.
+
+## Validation
+```bash
+npm run test:domain
+```
+
+## Product modules represented
+- Voice + chat (tokenized room auth, realtime chat)
+- Squad system (party-up, temporary squads, invite/join patterns)
+- Presence service (planned)
+- Communities (planned)
+- Moderation (planned)
+- Monetization (planned)
+- Growth loops (planned)
+- Admin analytics dashboard model
+
+## Scaling targets
+- Designed for millions of concurrent users via sharded realtime gateways, SFU clusters, edge caching, and Redis-backed event fanout.
